Badminton footwork determines whether you can hit the ball steadily or not, practice badminton step for a while every day, so that I can play better on the court

Main Functions:
1. Adjust the "practice position", "number of groups" and "frequency" according to your own needs, and then start practicing;
2. Larger graphics will be displayed on iPad for easy viewing;
3. Open "Sound Effect" for a more immersive practice experience;
4. "Dynamic Speed" dynamically adjusts the speed based on your Settings to be closer to the real race;
5. Support multiple languages.

All data in the software is stored locally and no network requests are sent.

“Racquet Sports: Track My Calories” will help your Apple Watch counting how many calories did you burn during your racquet game.

ACTIVITY
Track your calories, save results to your history of Activities and then view detailed summary per minute! App can count your calories during the next activities:
• Badminton;
• Cricket;
• Racquetball;
• Squash;
• Table Tennis;
• Tennis;
• Other.

SUMMARY
You can view the overall summary from all "Track My" series apps you have installed on your iPhone.  Find out total steps, distance and calories recorded during the all your Activities. Also you can view the summary per each app separately.

MORE
View the list of all existing “Track My“ series apps. Easily navigate between them or install them directly from the App Store. Also you will few great suggestions how to improve your fitness experience.

HEATLH INTEGRATION
App has integration with Health app, so all your progress is also will be stored in there.

Check out more apps from “Track My” series!
